  "author": "ritikchaddha",
  "severity": "MEDIUM",
  "description": "A Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) vulnerability exists in the default installation of MAMP server. The file `/Applications/MAMP/htdocs/index.php` is susceptible to malicious input, allowing attackers to inject JavaScript code that executes in the context of the victim\u0027s browser. This vulnerability can be exploited without prior authentication.\n",
